  "body": "## Changelog\n\n## 🧰 Tasks\n- [5b87172](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/5b87172) **release**: prepare release v0.11.1\n- [25ef66f](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/25ef66f) Bump the production-dependencies-patch-updates group across 1 directory with 3 updates (#779), closes [#779](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/779)\n- [d17e285](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/d17e285) Bump the development-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 updates (#782), closes [#782](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/782)\n- [0fb7b34](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/0fb7b34) Bump the github-actions group across 1 directory with 2 updates (#780), closes [#780](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/780)\n- [914ae2a](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/914ae2a) Bump com.diffplug.spotless:spotless-maven-plugin (#777), closes [#777](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/777)\n- [dba3f34](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/dba3f34) **release**: prepare for next development iteration"
